# prose_translation = For I was praying that I myself might be accursed, cut off from Christ, on behalf of my brothers, my kinsmen according to the flesh, who are Israelites, to whom belong the adoption as sons, and the glory, and the covenants, and the giving of the law, and the worship, and the promises; whose are the fathers, and from whom is the Christ according to the flesh, who is over all things, God blessed forever. Amen.
