# sentence_id = 449
# translation_lang = en
# prose_translation = but now, having no longer any place in these regions, and having a longing to come to you for many years, whenever I journey to Spain—for I hope to see you as I pass through, and to be sent on my way there by you, if first I may be somewhat filled with your company—but now I am going to Jerusalem, ministering to the saints.
# literal_translation = but now, no longer having a place in these regions, and having a longing of coming to you from sufficient years, whenever I might journey into Spain—for I hope, journeying through, to see you and to be sent forward there by you, if of you first I might be filled in part—but now I journey into Jerusalem, ministering to the saints.
