# sentence_id = 455
# translation_lang = en
# prose_translation = Now I urge you, brothers, through our Lord Jesus Christ and through the love of the Spirit, to strive together with me in your prayers to God on my behalf, that I may be rescued from those who are disobedient in Judea, and that my service for Jerusalem may be acceptable to the saints, so that, coming to you in joy by the will of God, I may rest together with you.
# literal_translation = I urge now you, [, brothers, ], through the Lord of us Jesus Christ and through the love of the Spirit, to strive-together with me in the prayers on behalf of me toward God, in order that I might be rescued from the ones disobeying in Judea, and the service of me, the one for Jerusalem, might become acceptable to the saints, in order that in joy having come to you through the will of God I might rest-together-with you.
